@api = http://localhost:5080/api

### Create a site
POST {{api}}/sites
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Johannesburg Warehouse" }

### List sites
GET {{api}}/sites

### Create a meter on site 1
POST {{api}}/sites/1/meters
Content-Type: application/json

{ "serialNumber": "MTR-0002" }

### List meters for site 1
GET {{api}}/sites/1/meters

### Add a reading to meter 1
POST {{api}}/meters/1/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timestampUtc": "2026-11-03T08:00:00Z", "valueKwh": 12580.4 }

### Same timestamp again -> 409 Conflict
POST {{api}}/meters/1/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timestampUtc": "2026-11-03T08:00:00Z", "valueKwh": 12590.0 }

### List readings for meter 1 in a range (both bounds optional, inclusive)
GET {{api}}/meters/1/readings?fromUtc=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-11-02T23:59:59Z

### Consumption summary
GET {{api}}/meters/1/summary?fromUtc=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&toUtc=2026-11-02T23:59:59Z
